{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Backrooms: Labyrinth Glitch</strong> is a cooperative horror experience for 1\u20134 players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Silence has a sound \u2014 and it\u2019s not what it should be.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every step feels wrong, every shadow seems to move when you\u2019re not looking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The only question is: how long can you keep going?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Scary atmosphere! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 1 to 4 player co-op!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Proximity voice chat </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Immersive AI </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Game Difficulties </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Stealth </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Large &amp; difficult map </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Primitive but challenging gameplay </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Important Notes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is not a typical Backrooms game. It doesn\u2019t follow every detail from the online community. Instead, it offers a unique interpretation, integrating select elements in a fresh and atmospheric way. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game includes flickering lights and audiovisual effects that may affect sensitive players. </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4163010?t=1764349219","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4163010?t=1764349219","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4163010/8fb8b77364a3c58a94b374f513bdcc9a9959355c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764349219","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4163010/8fb8b77364a3c58a94b374f513bdcc9a9959355c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764349219","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"LAN Co-op","id":48},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Backrooms: Labyrinth Glitch</strong> is a cooperative horror experience for 1\u20134 players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Silence has a sound \u2014 and it\u2019s not what it should be.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every step feels wrong, every shadow seems to move when you\u2019re not looking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The only question is: how long can you keep going?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Scary atmosphere! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 1 to 4 player co-op!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Proximity voice chat </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Immersive AI </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Game Difficulties </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Stealth </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Large &amp; difficult map </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Primitive but challenging gameplay </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Important Notes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is not a typical Backrooms game. It doesn\u2019t follow every detail from the online community. Instead, it offers a unique interpretation, integrating select elements in a fresh and atmospheric way. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game includes flickering lights and audiovisual effects that may affect sensitive players. </p>","developers":["Skmaestro"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4163010/75e15ce5a09243206ee6caf5789842378fcd266b/header.jpg?t=1764349219","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirem